   "source": [
    "DataFrame students\n",
    "+-------------+--------+\n",
    "| Column Name | Type   |\n",
    "+-------------+--------+\n",
    "| student_id  | int    |\n",
    "| name        | object |\n",
    "| age         | int    |\n",
    "+-------------+--------+\n",
    "\n",
    "Write a solution to select the name and age of the student with student_id = 101.\n",
    "\n",
    "The result format is in the following example.\n",
    "\n",
    " \n",
    "\n",
    "Example 1:\n",
    "Input:\n",
    "+------------+---------+-----+\n",
    "| student_id | name    | age |\n",
    "+------------+---------+-----+\n",
    "| 101        | Ulysses | 13  |\n",
    "| 53         | William | 10  |\n",
    "| 128        | Henry   | 6   |\n",
    "| 3          | Henry   | 11  |\n",
    "+------------+---------+-----+\n",
    "Output:\n",
    "+---------+-----+\n",
    "| name    | age | \n",
    "+---------+-----+\n",
    "| Ulysses | 13  |\n",
    "+---------+-----+\n",
    "Explanation:\n",
    "Student Ulysses has student_id = 101, we select the name and age."
   ]
